tools/frgen/__init__.py:8:(FeynRulesModel) + renderer, exposed via GenerateFeynRulesModelTool.\ntools/frgen/render.py:2:# render.py is a part of the HEPTAPOD package.\ntools/frgen/render.py:109:def render_information(info) -> str:\ntools/frgen/render.py:120:def _render_gauge_group(g: GaugeGroup) -> str:\ntools/frgen/render.py:137:def render_gauge_groups(groups: List[GaugeGroup]) -> str:\ntools/frgen/render.py:138:    entries = \",\\n\".join(_render_gauge_group(g) for g in groups)\ntools/frgen/render.py:142:def render_index_decls(decls: List[IndexDecl]) -> str:\ntools/frgen/render.py:156:def _render_parameter(p: Parameter) -> str:\ntools/frgen/render.py:164:                (\"{\" + \", \".join(r.render() for r in p.value_rules) + \"}\")\ntools/frgen/render.py:182:            (\"{\" + \", \".join(r.render() for r in p.definitions) + \"}\")\ntools/frgen/render.py:201:def render_parameters(params: List[Parameter]) -> str:\ntools/frgen/render.py:202:    entries = \",\\n\".join(_render_parameter(p) for p in params)\ntools/frgen/render.py:206:def _render_particle(p: ParticleClass) -> str:\ntools/frgen/render.py:249:def render_classes(particles: List[ParticleClass]) -> str:\ntools/frgen/render.py:250:    entries = \",\\n\".join(_render_particle(p) for p in particles)\ntools/frgen/render.py:254:def render_model(model: FeynRulesModel) -> str:\ntools/frgen/render.py:256:    sections: List[str] = [render_information(model.info)]\ntools/frgen/render.py:274:        sections.append(render_index_decls(model.index_decls))\ntools/frgen/render.py:276:        sections.append(render_gauge_groups(model.gauge_groups))\ntools/frgen/render.py:278:        sections.append(render_parameters(model.parameters))\ntools/frgen/render.py:280:        sections.append(render_classes(model.particles))\ntools/frgen/render.py:305:    return template.render(model_name=model.model_name, body=\"\\n\\n\".join(sections))\ntools/frgen/frmodel.py:10:by the ``.fr`` generator (render.py). Design principle: STRUCTU